# Telegram

- Telethon MUST be imported only inside `app/infrastructure/telegram/` (plus auth entry alias that delegates there).
- Event handlers MUST remain thin; no parsing, validation, risk, or order logic.
- Every event MUST receive a stable `event_id`.
- A Telegram message MUST NEVER directly trigger a trade / order.
- Original Telegram message timestamps MUST be preserved on the internal DTO.
- Edited messages MUST be distinct from new messages (`MESSAGE_EDITED` vs `NEW_MESSAGE`).
- Transport MUST NOT filter by signal age; age eligibility belongs to a future validator.
- Source chat MUST come from configuration, never hardcoded.
